{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国ツアースタートしましたっ\nまずは仙台で！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブの内容は秘密だからいえないけど、\nさいっこうに盛り上がってたのしかった！\nそして、牛タン美味しかった～～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、早朝からお仕事❥❥\nむっちゃ朝早くからだったけど、\n楽しすぎて元気でした～٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その後、\n次の予定までちょこっと\n大好きユカフィンとデート！\nハニーシナモンいってきたよ。"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなかなかなちゃんにも会えて幸せ♡\n佳苗さんや遠藤さんにも会えちゃった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱりハニーシナモンは可愛いな～～\nだいすき～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとね、\nPECOCLUBもいったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなぺこちゃん\nプロデュースでかわいかった。♡\nこんなお家すみたーいって思う\nファンシーな空間だったよ...."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ユカフィンつきあってくれてありがとう。♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は、\n真夏の全国ツアーｉｎ名古屋だよ！！！\n来る人はいっしょに楽しもうね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなのサイリウムは、\nハートサイリウムだよー❥★✡✩\nない人は、普通の赤！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわごコールもよろしくね...！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～握手～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"京都握手会の服↓"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなにセクシーって言われた。\nこのトップスは、\n実は伊織とおそろいなの٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶ ♡\n一緒に買ったやつなの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋握手会の写真↓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペアpvの\"にわにはにわ\"で\n使ったシースルーワンピ。\n頭にシェルつけたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レーンは、お花畑だったよ～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手にきたファンの人が\n一本ずつお花をさしていくっていう\npopのお祝いとして\nファンの人が用意してくれた企画٩꒰｡>v<｡꒱۶"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すっごい綺麗だったな～"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございましたっ！❥★✡✩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.kawago/img/blog/hina.kawago/img/2015/08/08/6036470/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このブログ書きながら\n何回もねちゃった笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"睡魔におそわれて\nいま文章がうまくかけない。、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新するね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい>_<！"}],"source":"archive"}